<h1>Using the charstring class</h1>

<ul>
  <li><a href="#intro">Introduction</a></li>
  <li><a href="#manip">Manipulating Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#comp">Comparing Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#find">Finding Data in Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#trans">Transforming Character Strings</a></li>
  <li><a href="#parsing">Parsing Character Strings</a></li>
